{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.QBeta.MeromorphicSameOrder","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.QBeta.MeromorphicSameOrder","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Analysis.Meromorphic.Order","lean:module:Mathlib.Analysis.Complex.Basic"],"declarations":6,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:meromorphicOrderAt_orderDiff_periodic","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"meromorphicOrderAt_orderDiff_periodic","kind":"theorem","line":127,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/MeromorphicSameOrder.lean#L127-L141","doc":"**Route-B step 2 (conclusion, UNCONDITIONAL): order-difference periodicity.**\nTwo solutions `Φ, Ψ` of the *same* first-order q-difference equation `f(·+c) = P·f`\nhave their order-difference preserved by one `c`-shift:\n`ord Ψ (x+c) + ord Φ x = ord Φ (x+c) + ord Ψ x`. Discharges the translation input\nvia brick (a) `meromorphicOrderAt_comp_add`; nothing is axiomatized. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:meromorphicOrderAt_sharedPrefactor_balance","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"meromorphicOrderAt_sharedPrefactor_balance","kind":"theorem","line":116,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/MeromorphicSameOrder.lean#L116-L125","doc":"**Shared-prefactor order balance** (route-B step 2). For meromorphic\n`Φ, Ψ, P` at `x`, the prefactor `P`'s order cancels between the two shifted\nsolutions: `ord(P·Ψ) + ord Φ = ord(P·Φ) + ord Ψ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:meromorphicOrderAt_comp_add","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"meromorphicOrderAt_comp_add","kind":"theorem","line":91,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/MeromorphicSameOrder.lean#L91-L114","doc":"**Brick (a): translation invariance of the meromorphic order.**\n`meromorphicOrderAt (g ∘ (·+c)) x = meromorphicOrderAt g (x+c)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:meromorphicAt_comp_add_iff","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"meromorphicAt_comp_add_iff","kind":"theorem","line":81,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/MeromorphicSameOrder.lean#L81-L89","doc":"Meromorphy transported both ways under `z ↦ z + c`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:meromorphicAt_comp_add","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"meromorphicAt_comp_add","kind":"theorem","line":66,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/MeromorphicSameOrder.lean#L66-L79","doc":"Meromorphy is preserved by the translation `z ↦ z + c`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:tendsto_add_right_nhdsWithin_ne","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"tendsto_add_right_nhdsWithin_ne","kind":"theorem","line":56,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/MeromorphicSameOrder.lean#L56-L64","doc":"Translation `z ↦ z + c` tends within punctured neighborhoods:\n`𝓝[≠] x → 𝓝[≠] (x + c)`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}